cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite version 1.0.0 at tag afm-artifact-v1.0.0."
title: "Determinantal Ideals in Lean 4"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the Gröbner-basis component of Sturmfels's theorem
  for determinantal ideals, including KRS and straightening-law infrastructure,
  a total-degree Hilbert-function argument, interreduction of the original
  minors, and a coefficient-normalized reduced Gröbner-basis refinement.
authors:
  - given-names: Jiabai
    family-names: Wang
repository-code: "https://github.com/WangJiabai/Determinantal-Ideals-Formalization"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formalized mathematics"
  - "Gröbner basis"
  - "determinantal ideal"
  - "standard monomial theory"
  - "KRS correspondence"
  - "straightening law"
